    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναφῠγή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναφεύγω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>escape, release from,</i>
			
